/*
 * Implements semantic validation for field initialization inside constructors.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of default field initializers,
 *   - validation of explicit field initializers in constructor declarations,
 *   - detection of missing or duplicated field initialization,
 *   - creation of proxy accessors for `self` and `super`,
 *   - enforcement of struct/class initialization rules,
 *   - construction of the pre-construction block for constructors.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::function::ctor::fields
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/function/ctor/fields.yr
